solution:
【Solution】Solution: $2010 \div 2=505$;
Therefore, there are 505 odd numbers and 505 even numbers,
the average of the sum of odd numbers is the one right in the middle, the average of the sum of even numbers is also the one right in the middle;
Therefore, their averages differ by 1;
That is, $2345+1=2346$.
So the answer is: 2346.

